  tutorial:
  - Press Y to toggle BUILD mode
  - Press R1&L1 to switch item
  - 'Building costs purified crystals.

    Press R2 to build.'
  - 'Dead enemies will drop crystals.

    When something you built kills them, those
    crystals will go to you.'
  - "Another way to get crystals is to DISMANTLE\nDid you see the red X amongst the
    items? \nUse that to DISMANTLE what you just built"
  - 'When not in BUILD you can ATTACK enemies directly with R2.

    Move the Right
    Stick around to AIM'
